WEBVTT

00:10:57.594 --> 00:11:04.594
(Laughter)

00:11:05.465 --> 00:11:09.435
I mean, it's distinctive,

00:11:09.459 --> 00:11:11.304
I'll give them that.

00:11:12.114 --> 00:11:14.767
Steve Kodis: It was adopted in 1955.

00:11:14.791 --> 00:11:16.070
RM: The city ran a contest

00:11:16.094 --> 00:11:19.489
and gathered a bunch of submissions
with all kinds of designs.

00:11:19.513 --> 00:11:23.720
SK: And an alderman
by the name of Fred Steffan

00:11:23.744 --> 00:11:30.051
cobbled together parts of the submissions
to make what is now the Milwaukee flag.